				Hdt.
				8.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἔρωτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermesian.
					7.42
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν καρδίαν πληγεὶς ὑπὸ λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					218a
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Act.
			 of wines, when smelt or drunk, <i>overpower,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
